#      config.ts` (new file, outside upstream's tree) implements the
#      prisma read, 60s in-process cache, and `invalidateInstanceSigning-
#      Config()`. Pairs with overlay 011b (tsa.ts) which seeds the TSA
#      cache from the same config row.
#
# Why-not-additive: `getSigner()` and `signPdf()` are upstream exports
#      called directly by `seal-document.handler.ts`. There's no
#      extension point or DI to inject our resolver. Inline patch is
#      the only path.
#
# Upstream-merge-fragility: MEDIUM.
#   - The three integration sites anchor on function bodies that upstream
#     rarely touches. Last upstream commit on this file was the biome
#     lint sweep, 8671f269e.
#   - If upstream adds a new signing transport (e.g., AWS KMS), the
#     transport-selection switch in `getSigner()` would need to gain
